  "content": "<center>\n<h1 id=\"-allure-https-cdn-modrinth-com-data-cached_images-25a4c46694c80f132aca77eb734555b1c517a8e8-png-\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4d5e345af75b41c960f7052fac891045b8286834.png\" alt=\"Allure\"></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-pack/\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a2dd1324a19f7594a6e032659b78fb3e5e89a2d.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/allure-6439754/\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/48f3ed3f11e619ef7fea93c4344ae8f4ba233cb0.png\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/p4ncake\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1fab8f2e1518ab9f6373586085d9aa785e0e3b9d.png\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-Fi\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/C9Q6XFG8T8\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f5a8b8552da877af71a331499e3fffcb57b513a.png\" alt=\"Join our Community on Discord!\"></a></p><hr><p><strong>Allure</strong> 是一款 16x16 的開發中（W.I.P）資源包，憑藉其鮮豔的色彩和陰影風格，讓我的世界變得更加可愛。這個資源包的主要目標之一（除了包含世界中的所有紋理外）是廣泛的兼容性，它將支持從 Minecraft Alpha 1.2.2（第一個引入資源包的版本）開始的多個版本移植。<hr></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Al41w13V/images/f8d27dac82f7755f504b3f05464a5327db6de6eb.png\" alt=\"Minecraft\">\n(模型搭建與姿勢由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Quoraal\">Quoraal</a> 製作)<hr><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Al41w13V/images/a51613dc39e9b4c09dc2007373bcacd08d424688.webp\" alt=\"Enchanting table room\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Al41w13V/images/a60f5f8993280bdad0bb114b5bae067bde35227d.webp\" alt=\"A cute base in a birch forest\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Al41w13V/images/564f3d0935190f0b10fe64197eedaab60cff65e6.webp\" alt=\"End portal\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-pack/gallery\"><img alt=\"More Images\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3b36e316ea55626103bc9f1b84f3d8a58196465f.webp\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>常見問題解答：</h2>\n<details>\n<summary><b>Allure</b> 需要安裝任何模組才能運行嗎？</summary>\n不需要，使用 Allure 無需安裝任何模組。不過，如果您打算在模組環境中使用它，請不要使用 Optifine，因為 Allure 依賴原版核心的光影功能，這通常與 Optifine 不兼容。如果您使用的是 Fabric 端，建議搭配 Sodium、ETF、EMF、Continuity 和 Polytone 一起使用。\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary><b>Allure</b> 支援哪些模組？</summary>\nAllure 的主要目標是實現與所有內容的通用兼容性，因此以下是與該資源包兼容的模組列表：\n</br></br></br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/appleskin\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bf2ace9afb60993e84fa57ce1233169fda76147e.png\" alt=\"AppleSkin\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/eating-animation\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ddcf28ce4287352bbd5cc3ade61cc1ebb02eb013.png\" alt=\"Eating Animation\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/axiom\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bdd5eedb2f817a264ada2313a7f5018ff24d4e7f.png\" alt=\"Axiom\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/make_bubbles_pop\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6850c1ab03252f61a829eca65ef306b7745c5849.png\" alt=\"Make Bubbles Pop\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/armor-toughness-bar\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/65fbf35fbb604934ff9eaf522b0eee95fc6e964c.png\" alt=\"Armor Toughness Bar\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crafting-tweaks\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47ff8e93c59f8f87809eb71792412104eed9be3b_0.webp\" alt=\"Crafting Tweaks\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n\n</details>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e7887614b1e17bec66022c5f2ba62343088d36d3.png\" alt=\"Allure is still W.I.P, if you find any bugs or want to give feedback, consider joining my Discord server!\"></p>\n<p>資源包仍在開發中，請耐心等待更新 💛\n如果您想獲取資源包進度的更新通知，歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/C9Q6XFG8T8\">點擊這裡</a>！</p>\n<br><br><hr>\n<h1>其他專案！</h1>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-fresh-animations-support\"><img alt=\"Allure Fresh Animations Support\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a4b12553ad59462994b06b9f7124fd36c9a81138.webp\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-emoji-pack\"><img alt=\"Allure Emoji Pack\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62de9de72ccd55e8a14fd4b637eb9c54dd0fb888.png\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-3d-plants\"><img alt=\"Allure 3D Plants\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a46651adb88e91abf37823d73fa1b42f66d4b596.webp\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-dark-theme-gui\"><img alt=\"Allure Dark Theme GUI\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f8deee765f891b6ca092c2ae5c120c8ea01c9007.webp\"></a>\n</center>",
